  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "18BBF8C142F9FD38",
      "text": "Bonjour, les enfants ! J’espère qu’il vous tarde\\nd’en apprendre plus sur la biologie ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "18BBFBC142FA0251",
      "text": "Souvenez-vous, lors du précédent cours, je vous\\nai parlé d’un sujet très important : les Œufs ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "18BBFAC142FA009E",
      "text": "Tiens, ça me fait penser...\\nEst-ce que vous vous servez de votre Pokédex ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "18BBFDC142FA05B7",
      "text": "Sachez que les Pokémon qui naissent des Œufs\\ny sont aussi enregistrés. Donc, rassurez-vous :\\r\\naucune donnée n’est perdue ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "18BBFCC142FA0404",
      "text": "Et vous savez quoi ? C’est moi qui ai mis\\nau point l’application Pokédex ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "18BBFFC142FA091D",
      "text": "C’était bien avant que je n’enseigne dans\\ncette académie.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "18BBFEC142FA076A",
      "text": "À l’époque, j’étais chercheur.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "18BBF1C142F9F153",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, monsieur Clavel travaillait dans\\nle même laboratoire que moi.\\r\\nIl n’était pas encore professeur, lui non plus.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "18BBF0C142F9EFA0",
      "text": "Nous étudiions les Pokémon, tous les deux.\\nC’était vraiment passionnant !\\r\\nEn revanche, je me faisais souvent réprimander...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "18B873C142F6E562",
      "text": "... Pourquoi est-ce que je vous raconte tout ça,\\nmoi ? Je voulais vous parler du Pokédex...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "18B874C142F6E715",
      "text": "Ah, oui ! Le cours d’aujourd’hui porte sur\\nla capture des Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "18B871C142F6E1FC",
      "text": "Comme vous le savez, pour attraper un Pokémon,\\nil faut d’abord réduire ses PV.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "18B872C142F6E3AF",
      "text": "Mais il y a aussi une autre technique qui facilite\\nla capture. En quoi consiste-t-elle, à votre avis ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "288E982D51062E98",
      "text": "Donner une Baie au Pokémon.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "288E9B2D510633B1",
      "text": "Infliger une altération de statut au Pokémon.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "288E9A2D510631FE",
      "text": "Montrer au Pokémon qui est l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A08)]e patrona patronne.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A08"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "57B2167AC5FF2F01",
      "text": "Hmmm... C’est peut-être valable dans une autre\\nrégion, mais il me semble que ça ne fonctionnera\\r\\npas à Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "57B2137AC5FF29E8",
      "text": "Bien vu, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nJe suis impressionné ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "57B2147AC5FF2B9B",
      "text": "... C’est une façon de voir les choses.\\c\\nCela dit, tu n’as pas tort. Envoyer un Pokémon\\npuissant au combat procure un certain avantage.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "18B86FC142F6DE96",
      "text": "Comme je le disais, il existe une autre technique\\nqui facilite la capture : il s’agit d’infliger aux\\r\\nPokémon une altération de statut.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "18B870C142F6E049",
      "text": "Vous aurez notamment de grandes chances\\nde réussir vos captures si vous les endormez.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "18B86DC142F6DB30",
      "text": "Les capacités qui endorment l’adversaire, comme\\nPoudre Dodo et Hypnose, vous seront très utiles\\r\\npour compléter votre Pokédex ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "18B86EC142F6DCE3",
      "text": "Mais ce ne sont pas les seules astuces qui\\nexistent.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "18B87BC142F6F2FA",
      "text": "Il est aussi conseillé de choisir des Poké Balls\\nadaptées, d’obtenir une Aura Capture\\r\\nen mangeant, ou bien d’attaquer\\r\\nles Pokémon par-derrière.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "18B87CC142F6F4AD",
      "text": "Et si vous éprouvez toujours des difficultés,\\nallez récupérer quelques Badges d’Arène.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "18B4EDC142F3CBD9",
      "text": "Cela rendra plus facile la capture de Pokémon de\\nniveaux plus élevés, ce qui est non négligeable.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "18B4ECC142F3CA26",
      "text": "N’hésitez pas à me montrer vos Pokédex quand\\nils commenceront à être bien remplis ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "18B4EBC142F3C873",
      "text": "C’est tout pour aujourd’hui. N’oubliez pas que\\nvous aurez un contrôle lors du prochain cours ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
